    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Chandroid Sweetheart is a puzzle metroidvania game where you and your robot girlfriend explore the city of Electropica in search of the thief that stole her memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your Chandroid to step on buttons and operate terminals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/7f204975467757b87fe8292f984f2a79.poster.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/7f204975467757b87fe8292f984f2a79.webm?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/7f204975467757b87fe8292f984f2a79.mp4?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, collect, and trade for cosmetics\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/936930c1c76ebbeb812a005652fd15d6.poster.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/936930c1c76ebbeb812a005652fd15d6.webm?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/936930c1c76ebbeb812a005652fd15d6.mp4?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter new puzzle elements and upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/4218e626f226391af4d11b70ef9fbe89.poster.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/4218e626f226391af4d11b70ef9fbe89.webm?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/4218e626f226391af4d11b70ef9fbe89.mp4?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And find that thief!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/44e5b51c3fd32791ceb475f690bc812a.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=255 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >My Chandroid Sweetheart is a puzzle metroidvania game where you and your robot girlfriend explore the city of Electropica in search of the thief that stole her memories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Command your Chandroid to step on buttons and operate terminals</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/7f204975467757b87fe8292f984f2a79.poster.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/7f204975467757b87fe8292f984f2a79.webm?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/7f204975467757b87fe8292f984f2a79.mp4?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore, collect, and trade for cosmetics\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/936930c1c76ebbeb812a005652fd15d6.poster.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/936930c1c76ebbeb812a005652fd15d6.webm?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/936930c1c76ebbeb812a005652fd15d6.mp4?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Encounter new puzzle elements and upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/4218e626f226391af4d11b70ef9fbe89.poster.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/4218e626f226391af4d11b70ef9fbe89.webm?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/4218e626f226391af4d11b70ef9fbe89.mp4?t=1740315154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>And find that thief!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3304280/extras/44e5b51c3fd32791ceb475f690bc812a.avif?t=1740315154\" width=616 height=255 /></span></p>",
